{"title":"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\tWhich of the following is the derivative of the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a3362a7e42387725a35f9ba9776a98010f8e026.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = e^{e^{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"22\" />?\n</p><p>\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/3/a1334d1773c002c1848c941197fcb488dd10de04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ f&#39;(x) = f(f(x))  \\quad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ f&#39;(x) = f(x) \\ln f(x)  \\quad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ f&#39;(x) = e^{f(x)}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ f&#39;(x) = f(x)  \\quad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ f&#39;(x) = \\ln f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"837\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>\t==Solution 1==\n\tBy the chain rule with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1eee34e4c014256099a992702c4ae788e1545e51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = e^{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />,\n\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/321851d4e99839914d7270d02f1e866c6758841f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f&#39;(x) = e^{e^{x}} \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}\\left[ e^{x} \\right] = e^{e^{x}}\\cdot e^{x}.\\]\" width=\"234\" height=\"37\" />\n\tComparing the answers, we see that only\n\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/4784c17ab4d2e816081c5bfc35a2435e6b9de734.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{ \\textbf{(B)}\\ f&#39;(x) = f(x) \\ln f(x) } = e^{e^{x}}\\ln \\left(e^{e^{x}}\\right) = e^{e^{x}}\\cdot e^{x}\\]\" width=\"385\" height=\"30\" />\n\tmatches the derivative. The other answers are, in order,\n\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b5758d879a6a5afb32bad684802c436fd101ded8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[e^{e^{e^{e^{x}}}}; \\quad e^{e^{x}} \\quad e^{e^{x}} \\quad e^{x},\\]\" width=\"160\" height=\"27\" />\n\tnone of which match <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bbad379658bd32e9b6479bbd666b93a96e6b48ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f&#39;(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2026 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"20